(## 1. Executive summary) Tj T*
( ) Tj T*
(FeeFlow is an MVP SaaS for Company A \(Jaipur coaching\) that gives parents a clear dues view with pay links, ) Tj T*
( ) Tj T*
(## 2. Original business problem) Tj T*
( ) Tj T*
(Desktop fee software + Excel due dates + phone chasing. Estimated leakage: late follow-up \(~?62.4L never coll) Tj T*
( ) Tj T*
(## 3. Business impact calculations) Tj T*
( ) Tj T*
(From the brief \(preserved\): 2,600 × ?1.2L = ?31.2Cr billed; 2% uncollected ? ?62.4L; staff chasing ? ?16.8L;) Tj T*
( ) Tj T*
(## 4. Product scope) Tj T*
( ) Tj T*
(**In MVP:** fee ledger, parent OTP portal, mock pay + receipt, reminder cancel-on-pay, refund calculator, dues) Tj T*
(**Roles:** Parent, Accounts Executive.  ) Tj T*
(**Out of scope:** LMS, timetables, admissions CRM.) Tj T*
( ) Tj T*
